{
  "uid": "dkg-sync-cost",
  "title": "DKG Nodes — Sync Cost",
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "1m",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-6h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "tags": [
    "dkg",
    "metrics",
    "sync"
  ],
  "links": [
    {
      "type": "dashboards",
      "tags": [
        "dkg"
      ],
      "asDropdown": true,
      "title": "DKG dashboards",
      "includeVars": false,
      "keepTime": true
    }
  ],
  "description": "PR #2033 W1 source-attributed sync telemetry (I1–I9). Node label profile: instance. The dashboard is an interactive operational view; the generated w1/w1-queries.md remains the fixed 1 h / 2 h decision contract.",
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "vm",
        "type": "datasource",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "label": "Metrics DS",
        "hide": 2,
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "node",
        "label": "Node",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${vm}"
        },
        "query": "label_values({__name__=~\"dkg_.+\"}, instance)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "allowCustomValue": true,
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "sync_source",
        "label": "Sync source",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "catchup-foreground,on-connect,reconcile,catchup-background,vm-recovery,swm-recovery,control-plane,unspecified",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "sync_lane",
        "label": "Operation lane",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "durable,changelog,shared_memory,swm_recovery",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      },
      {
        "name": "sync_outcome",
        "label": "Operation outcome",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "resolved,error,cancelled",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "allValue": ".+",
        "current": {
          "text": [
            "All"
          ],
          "value": [
            "$__all"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Requires the extended sync diagnostics from PR #2033 and node metric export.** The flame graph and duration heatmaps use real OpenTelemetry counters/histograms, while the existing **DKG Node — Logs** pressure views continue to use Loki transition/summary records. Filter the interactive operation views with the source/lane/outcome controls above. The evidence and materiality panels intentionally retain W1's fixed durable filters and source-family rules; a failed gate means **inconclusive**, not healthy."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Source-attributed sync cost (I1–I4)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 3
      },
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Source-attributed sync active occupancy — $node",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 14,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "description": "Hierarchy is source → requester lane → terminal outcome. Width is completed logical-sync active wall-clock occupancy accumulated over the selected Grafana range. It is admitted occupancy, not CPU time, and excludes rejected-before-start operations (shown separately).",
      "options": {
        "showFlameGraphOnly": false
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(increase({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_operation_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_sum\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", outcome=~\"${sync_outcome:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "0|0|all selected sync occupancy",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (source) (increase({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_operation_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_sum\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", outcome=~\"${sync_outcome:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "1|0|{{source}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "C",
          "expr": "sum by (source, lane) (increase({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_operation_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_sum\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", outcome=~\"${sync_outcome:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "2|0|{{source}}/{{lane}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "editorMode": "code"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "D",
          "expr": "sum by (source, lane, outcome) (increase({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_operation_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_sum\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", outcome=~\"${sync_outcome:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "3|1|{{source}}/{{lane}}/{{outcome}}",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "queryType": "instant",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "seriesToRows",
          "options": {}
        },
        {
          "id": "extractFields",
          "options": {
            "source": "Metric",
            "format": "regexp",
            "regexp": "(?<level>\\d+)\\|(?<leaf>[01])\\|(?<label>.*)",
            "replace": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "convertFieldType",
          "options": {
            "conversions": [
              {
                "targetField": "level",
                "destinationType": "number"
              },
              {
                "targetField": "leaf",
                "destinationType": "number"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "calculateField",
          "options": {
            "mode": "binary",
            "binary": {
              "left": {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "Value"
                }
              },
              "operator": "*",
              "right": {
                "matcher": {
                  "id": "byName",
                  "options": "leaf"
                }
              }
            },
            "alias": "self",
            "replaceFields": false
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "Metric": true,
              "leaf": true
            },
            "indexByName": {
              "level": 0,
              "label": 1,
              "Value": 2,
              "self": 3
            },
            "renameByName": {
              "Value": "value"
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Physical sync attempts by source/outcome (I1)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (source, outcome, transport, plane, phase) (rate(dkg_sync_attempt_total{source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} · {{outcome}} · {{transport}}/{{plane}}/{{phase}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Encoded payload throughput by source (I2 + I3)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "Bps"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (source) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_attempt_request_bytes(_total)?\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "request · {{source}}"
        },
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "sum by (source, outcome) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_attempt_response_bytes(_total)?\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "response · {{source}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Average active worker equivalents (I4 sum)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 18
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (source, lane, outcome) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_operation_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_sum\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", outcome=~\"${sync_outcome:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])) / 1000",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} · {{lane}} · {{outcome}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Logical sync operation duration heatmap (I4)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 27
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "heatmap",
      "description": "Completed logical-sync duration distribution for the selected source/lane/outcome filters. Rejected-before-start work is excluded by contract and appears in I5.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "cellValues": {},
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Reds",
          "steps": 64,
          "reverse": false,
          "scale": "exponential",
          "exponent": 0.5
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 0
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "showColorScale": true,
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "reverse": false,
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_operation_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_bucket\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", outcome=~\"${sync_outcome:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Sync scheduler queue-wait heatmap (corroborating P1)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 27
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "heatmap",
      "description": "Queue-wait distribution for the sync-global scheduler and selected operation lanes. This corroborates W1 cost; it is not one of I1–I9.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "cellValues": {},
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Oranges",
          "steps": 64,
          "reverse": false,
          "scale": "exponential",
          "exponent": 0.5
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 0
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "showColorScale": true,
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "reverse": false,
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_sync_scheduler_queue_wait_ms(_milliseconds)?_bucket\", scheduler=\"sync-global\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Oldest queued sync item age by lane (corroborating P2)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 7,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 39
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "max by (lane) ({__name__=~\"dkg_backpressure_oldest_queued_age_ms(_milliseconds)?\", scheduler=\"sync-global\", lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{lane}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Admission and coalescing (I5–I6)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 46
      },
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Operations rejected before starting (I5)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 47
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (lane, source, reason) (rate(dkg_sync_operation_rejected_total{lane=~\"${sync_lane:regex}\", source=~\"${sync_source:regex}\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{source}} · {{lane}} · {{reason}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Single-flight joins (I6)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 47
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scope, owner_source, joiner_source) (rate(dkg_sync_singleflight_joins_total{instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scope}} · {{owner_source}} ← {{joiner_source}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Catch-up request and job accounting (I7–I9)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 56
      },
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "title": "Catch-up requests by route result (I7)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 57
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (result, include_shared_memory) (rate(dkg_context_graph_catchup_requests_total{instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}} · swm={{include_shared_memory}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Catch-up jobs by terminal state (I8)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 57
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (status, admission) (rate(dkg_context_graph_catchup_jobs_total{instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{status}} · {{admission}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Walk catch-up duration p95 (I9)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 57
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "timeseries",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_context_graph_catchup_job_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_bucket\", admission=\"walk\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "walk p95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Walk catch-up job duration heatmap (I9)",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 12,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 66
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "heatmap",
      "description": "Wall-clock duration distribution for real walk jobs. Synthetic already-ready jobs deliberately produce no zero-duration sample.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ms"
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "calculate": false,
        "cellGap": 1,
        "cellValues": {},
        "color": {
          "mode": "scheme",
          "scheme": "Blues",
          "steps": 64,
          "reverse": false,
          "scale": "exponential",
          "exponent": 0.5
        },
        "filterValues": {
          "le": 0
        },
        "legend": {
          "show": true
        },
        "rowsFrame": {
          "layout": "auto"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "single",
          "showColorScale": true,
          "yHistogram": true
        },
        "yAxis": {
          "axisPlacement": "left",
          "reverse": false,
          "unit": "ms"
        }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${vm}"
          },
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (le) (rate({__name__=~\"dkg_context_graph_catchup_job_duration_ms(_milliseconds)?_bucket\", admission=\"walk\", instance=~\"${node:regex}\"}[$__rate_interval]))",
          "format": "heatmap",
          "legendFormat": "{{le}}",
          "queryType": "range",
          "editorMode": "code"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "W1 evidence gates — selected Grafana range",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 78
      },
      "type": "row",
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 3,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 79
      },
      "type": "text",
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "These six panels are the same gate expressions as the generated W1 decision packet, evaluated over the selected Grafana range. Threshold colors encode the fixed contract where a numeric threshold exists. **All gates must pass** before interpreting the source-family shares; low export coverage must be compared with selected-range length ÷ scrape interval."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "title": "Completed durable operations",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 6,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 82
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${vm}"
      },
      "type": "stat",
      "description": "I4 count; must be at least 200.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": 200
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
